import{_ as o,o as i,c as a,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 994 | Hyper-Multiverse's Only Complete Civilizational Closed Loop · Closed-Loop Element 2 — Myriad-Rank Republicanism","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 994 | Hyper-Multiverse's Only Complete Civilizational Closed Loop · Closed-Loop Element 2 — Myriad-Rank Republicanism","no":994,"module":5,"tags":["Closed Loop","Element 2","Myriad-Rank Republicanism","Equal Evolution","99% Coverage"],"related":["05-Myriad Ranks Advance-Together Basic Program","903-Myriad-Rank Equal Evolution Right","50-Myriad-Rank Lineage Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0994_模块5-闭环要素二-万族共和.md","filePath":"en/0994_模块5-闭环要素二-万族共和.md"}`),t={name:"en/0994_模块5-闭环要素二-万族共和.md"};function s(l,e,r,u,d,c){return i(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-994-hyper-multiverse-s-only-complete-civilizational-closed-loop-·-closed-loop-element-2-—-myriad-rank-republicanism" tabindex="-1">Entry 994 | Hyper-Multiverse&#39;s Only Complete Civilizational Closed Loop · Closed-Loop Element 2 — Myriad-Rank Republicanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-994-hyper-multiverse-s-only-complete-civilizational-closed-loop-·-closed-loop-element-2-—-myriad-rank-republicanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 994 | Hyper-Multiverse&#39;s Only Complete Civilizational Closed Loop · Closed-Loop Element 2 — Myriad-Rank Republicanism&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Documents 05, 903, 50</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-on-the-loop-there-may-be-no-outsiders" tabindex="-1">Introduction: on the loop there may be no outsiders <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-on-the-loop-there-may-be-no-outsiders" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: on the loop there may be no outsiders&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Anti-predation replaced the momentum; the next question is: who is on the loop? The old cosmos&#39;s closed loop (actually open loop) has only a few on it — the protagonist, his followers, his clan; the rest of Myriad Ranks are fertilizer outside. This &quot;few people&#39;s closed loop&quot; must collapse, because those outside eventually smash the loop. Myriad-Rank republicanism is the six top-level axioms&#39; second cornerstone alongside anti-predation, expanding the closed loop&#39;s participants to the maximum: all beings have equal evolution qualifications, with 99% Myriad-Rank full coverage. Human men and women, Youth Supremes, alien beasts, plant spirits, planet consciousness, cosmic-origin bodies, and multiverse remnant civilizations all have a road.</p><h2 id="i-why-a-few-people-s-closed-loop-must-collapse" tabindex="-1">I: Why &quot;a Few People&#39;s Closed Loop&quot; Must Collapse <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-a-few-people-s-closed-loop-must-collapse" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I: Why &quot;a Few People&#39;s Closed Loop&quot; Must Collapse&quot;">​</a></h2><p>A local closed loop has three fatal points:</p><ol><li><strong>Too few participants</strong>: the loop spins smaller and smaller, with insufficient energy;</li><li><strong>Too many outsiders</strong>: those excluded from the loop are potential destroyers;</li><li><strong>Innovation dries up</strong>: a single group thinks of nothing new, and the loop grows older spinning.</li></ol><p>The old cosmos&#39;s sects, empires, and heavenly courts are all this few-people closed loop — finally overthrown by outsiders, or rotting from within.</p><h2 id="ii-how-myriad-rank-republicanism-expands-the-loop-to-the-maximum" tabindex="-1">II: How Myriad-Rank Republicanism Expands the Loop to the Maximum <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-how-myriad-rank-republicanism-expands-the-loop-to-the-maximum" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II: How Myriad-Rank Republicanism Expands the Loop to the Maximum&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Anchor Symbiotic closed loop&#39;s way:</p><ul><li><strong>99% full coverage</strong>: regardless of clan, realm, birth, or planet, all are on the loop, and all loop-entry records are archived in the Alaya Network;</li><li><strong>Everyone has a road</strong>: the Entry 975 guarantee system builds the road to every door;</li><li><strong>Equal evolution qualification</strong>: no one is excluded for being alien, young, or planet consciousness.</li></ul><p>No outsiders on the loop, and the loop may bear infinite expansion.</p><h2 id="iii-axiom-6-is-myriad-rank-republicanism-s-confidence" tabindex="-1">III: Axiom 6 Is Myriad-Rank Republicanism&#39;s Confidence <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-axiom-6-is-myriad-rank-republicanism-s-confidence" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III: Axiom 6 Is Myriad-Rank Republicanism&#39;s Confidence&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old cosmos did not dare truly preach Myriad-Rank republicanism, because resources finite — true equality means not enough to share. The Anchor Symbiotic dares, because of the universal equal infinite law: every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a floor and are not eliminated, and strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose higher infinity. Since origin is infinite, Myriad-Rank republicanism is no longer &quot;dividing the cake,&quot; but &quot;baking the cake together&quot; — equality thus has a physical basis.</p><h2 id="iv-closed-loop-verification-whom-does-myriad-rank-republicanism-lock" tabindex="-1">IV: Closed-Loop Verification: Whom Does Myriad-Rank Republicanism Lock <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-closed-loop-verification-whom-does-myriad-rank-republicanism-lock" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV: Closed-Loop Verification: Whom Does Myriad-Rank Republicanism Lock&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>It gives anti-predation an object (not taking whom? not taking every Myriad-Rank on the loop);</li><li>It gives collective ascension a subject (lifting whom? lifting every one on the loop);</li><li>It gives causal self-discipline a boundary (interfering in whose causality? respecting every one&#39;s autonomy on the loop);</li><li>It gives the law-first axiom universal meaning (law equally applies to every one on the loop).</li></ul><h2 id="v-myriad-rank-republicanism-s-end-a-circle-with-no-missing-corner" tabindex="-1">V: Myriad-Rank Republicanism&#39;s End: A Circle with No Missing Corner <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-myriad-rank-republicanism-s-end-a-circle-with-no-missing-corner" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V: Myriad-Rank Republicanism&#39;s End: A Circle with No Missing Corner&quot;">​</a></h2><p>When the closed loop is drawn to the Myriad-Rank-republicanism element, what is most worth emphasizing is &quot;no missing corner.&quot; Any old-cosmos &quot;Great Unity&quot; ideal finally secretly keeps a missing corner: this clan doesn&#39;t count, that life doesn&#39;t count, people at this stage don&#39;t count. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s Myriad-Rank republicanism fills the missing corners one by one: human men and women fill in the Youth-Supreme corner, Youth Supremes fill in the alien-beast and plant-spirit corner, then the planet-consciousness and cosmic-origin-body corner, finally even the multiverse-remnant-civilization corner. 99% full coverage does not mean &quot;more or less counts,&quot; but &quot;as long as it is a being, don&#39;t think it can be excluded.&quot; Why must it be filled to 99%? Because a missing corner is the loop&#39;s crack — where the crack is, the loop cannot close. Even if only one corner&#39;s beings are not included, that corner eventually becomes the hammer that smashes the loop. Only inviting the last corner&#39;s people into the loop does the loop truly close and truly be unsmashable.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: all Myriad-Rank wisdom enters the closed loop, not wasted by birth</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: no outsiders on the loop, and predation has structurally no object</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo systems&#39; Myriad Ranks are background; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Myriad Ranks are the loop&#39;s subject</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: this loop itself is Myriad-Rank full coverage institutionalized</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: newly incorporated multiversal civilizations automatically enter the loop</li></ul><h2 id="vi-myriad-rank-republicanism-is-not-equalitarianism-but-equal-qualification" tabindex="-1">VI: Myriad-Rank Republicanism Is Not Equalitarianism, But Equal Qualification <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-myriad-rank-republicanism-is-not-equalitarianism-but-equal-qualification" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI: Myriad-Rank Republicanism Is Not Equalitarianism, But Equal Qualification&quot;">​</a></h2><p>A common misunderstanding must also be clarified: Myriad-Rank republicanism is not &quot;everyone equally strong.&quot; The easygoing and strivers are of course different in power; Youth Supremes and ordinary mortals are of course different in realm. What Myriad-Rank republicanism guarantees is not outcome equality, but qualification equality — everyone has the same chance to enter the loop, with no one blocked at the door by birth; everyone&#39;s inherent basic infinite power is equally protected, with no one disqualified for &quot;not being strong enough.&quot; On this equal-qualification floor, you may keep the floor easygoing, or you may strive to superimpose higher infinity. The loop does not require everyone to walk at the same speed; it only requires no one be shut out. This is the true meaning of 99% full coverage.</p><h2 id="vii-no-outsiders-no-enemies" tabindex="-1">VII: No Outsiders, No Enemies <a class="header-anchor" href="#vii-no-outsiders-no-enemies" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VII: No Outsiders, No Enemies&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Myriad-Rank republicanism has another often-overlooked benefit: it structurally eliminates the concept of &quot;enemy.&quot; The old cosmos&#39;s civilizations always need an enemy outside themselves — either the next-door clan, or the otherworld fiend — to cohere internally. Myriad-Rank republicanism expands the loop to 99%, which is to tell Myriad Ranks: no one is outside the loop, so no one is born an enemy. The tiny remaining outside-the-loop existence is not destroyed as an enemy, but received as multiverse remnant civilization (Mechanism 24). When a civilization no longer needs an enemy to cohere itself, it escapes the old mode of &quot;maintaining internal unity by external predation.&quot; Myriad-Rank symbiosis, essentially, draws the boundary of &quot;us&quot; and &quot;them&quot; to the cosmos&#39;s edge.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Myriad-Rank republicanism is the closed loop&#39;s participant boundary. No outsiders on the loop, and the loop is unsmashable — this is the closed loop&#39;s everlasting demographic foundation.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/05-万族共进基本纲领.html">Entry 05 · Myriad Ranks Advance-Together Basic Program</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/903_模块5-第二条-万族平等进化权.html">Entry 903 · Myriad-Rank Equal Evolution Right</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/993_模块5-闭环要素一-反掠夺主义.html">Entry 993 · Closed-Loop Element 1</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const m=o(t,[["render",s]]);export{p as __pageData,m as default};
